      * SPEC: PROGRAM COLLATING SEQUENCE; AUDIT D02.
      * ZD110A: PROGRAM COLLATING SEQUENCE changes comparisons
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZD110A.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM
           PROGRAM COLLATING SEQUENCE CUSTOM-ORDER.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           ALPHABET CUSTOM-ORDER IS 'Z' 'A' '9'.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO REPORT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  REPORT-FILE
           RECORDING MODE F
           RECORD CONTAINS 120 CHARACTERS.
       01  REPORT-RECORD PIC X(120).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY ZCVSRPT.
       01  FIRST-CHAR PIC X VALUE 'Z'.
       01  SECOND-CHAR PIC X VALUE 'A'.
       01  THIRD-CHAR PIC X VALUE '9'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROC SECTION.
       MAIN-000.
           MOVE 'ZD110A' TO ZCVS-PROG-ID.
           PERFORM ZCVS-BEGIN.

           MOVE 'CUSTOM-FIRST-SECOND' TO ZCVS-TEST-NAME.
           IF FIRST-CHAR < SECOND-CHAR
               PERFORM ZCVS-PASS
           ELSE
               MOVE 'Z < A' TO ZCVS-EXPECTED
               MOVE FIRST-CHAR TO ZCVS-ACTUAL
               PERFORM ZCVS-FAIL
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'CUSTOM-SECOND-THIRD' TO ZCVS-TEST-NAME.
           IF SECOND-CHAR < THIRD-CHAR
               PERFORM ZCVS-PASS
           ELSE
               MOVE 'A < 9' TO ZCVS-EXPECTED
               MOVE SECOND-CHAR TO ZCVS-ACTUAL
               PERFORM ZCVS-FAIL
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'CUSTOM-LITERAL' TO ZCVS-TEST-NAME.
           IF FIRST-CHAR < 'A'
               PERFORM ZCVS-PASS
           ELSE
               MOVE 'Z < A' TO ZCVS-EXPECTED
               MOVE FIRST-CHAR TO ZCVS-ACTUAL
               PERFORM ZCVS-FAIL
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'CUSTOM-BYTES-SAME' TO ZCVS-TEST-NAME.
           IF FIRST-CHAR = X'E9' AND SECOND-CHAR = X'C1'
               PERFORM ZCVS-PASS
           ELSE
               MOVE 'E9/C1' TO ZCVS-EXPECTED
               MOVE FIRST-CHAR TO ZCVS-ACTUAL
               PERFORM ZCVS-FAIL
           END-IF.

           PERFORM ZCVS-END.
           MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE.
           STOP RUN.
           COPY ZCVSHEX.
           COPY ZCVSPROC.
